# GitHub Issues used as data backend (issue-per-card pattern).
# GITHUB_TOKEN: a PAT with `repo` scope (or fine-grained: Issues=Write on the data repo).
#   For local dev: `gh auth token` outputs your CLI token.
#   For prod: create a fine-grained PAT at github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta scoped to the data repo only.
# GITHUB_REPO: "<owner>/<repo>" of the data repository (it must have a `card` label).
# Set values with `printf` (not `echo`) to avoid trailing newlines.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
GITHUB_REPO=

# Gemini API key for AI Vibe Match (optional but recommended).
#   When set: each /create writes a 256-dim embedding of the vibe sentence.
#   The /match route uses cosine similarity to surface top-3 vibe twins.
#   When unset: cards still get created, /match shows an "AI matching
#   unavailable" empty state. /people works as a plain wall.
# Get from: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
